{"id":"140342deea557884","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-pi1-formula.md","title":"Pi 1 Formula","display":"df-pi1-formula — Pi_1 Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-pi1-formula","aliases":["92-df-pi1-formula"],"display":"df-pi1-formula — Pi_1 Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-godel-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-pi1-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-pi1-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi1-formula — Pi_1 Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> (first universal level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PiOne}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PiOne}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiOne}_G(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1^G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiOne}_G(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1^G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>的逻辑等价闭包，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>公式是逻辑等价于“非空全称量词块加有界矩阵”的公式，而不只是一种字面前束串</li>\n<li>对标准<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>可证性谓词，内部一致性句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\)</span>可取为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span></li>\n<li>在标准有效对角构造保持相应复杂度的条件下，Gödel固定点可选为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>句；仅有一条任意的可证固定点等价并不自动确定<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>的字面语法复杂度</li>\n<li>标准模型中为假的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>句有一个具体反例；含有足够基本算术的理论可以验证该反例并反驳原句</li>\n<li>相容、有效且足够强的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>不能证明全部真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>句；该不完备结论需要这些额外假设，而不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PiOne}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PiOne}_G\\)</span>定义的一部分</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi_1^G$ (first universal level, see [[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"按[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]的逻辑等价闭包，$\\Pi_1$公式是逻辑等价于“非空全称量词块加有界矩阵”的公式，而不只是一种字面前束串","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PiOne}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiOne}_G(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Pi_1^G","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PiOne}_G","display":false}],"bytes":1524,"backlinks":[{"id":"c4f0c170aff0bb4a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^G,\\Sigma_1^G,\\Pi_1^G$ (arithmetic-hierarchy classes, see [[92-df-delta0-formula]], [[92-df-sigma1-formula]], [[92-df-pi1-formula]])"},{"id":"645ee8d3e395cd8f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi_1^G$ (first universal level, see [[92-df-pi1-formula]])"},{"id":"b0cf42030c298d08","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi_1^G$ (first universal level, see [[92-df-pi1-formula]])"},{"id":"235651614fd28cce","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church